---
---
<section id="about" class="bg-cream py-20 px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Top Grid: About Story & Mission -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center mb-20">
      <!-- Left Column: Copy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal="fade-up">
        <span class="font-mono text-primary text-xs uppercase tracking-[2px] font-semibold block mb-4">
          About Al Sahra Tents & Sheds Fix
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[46px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.4px] text-ink mb-6">
          A one-stop partner in tents, tensile shade & structural steel.
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Al Sahra Tents & Sheds Fix was established in Sharjah with a single purpose — to deliver reliable sales, manufacturing, and service support in the field of tents and shade systems across the UAE.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Our strength lies in the comprehensive nature of the service we offer: an individually tailored, one-stop package backed by responsible operations, quality-focused execution, and innovative engineering — without compromising on realistic pricing. We call this philosophy <span class="font-semibold text-ink">"Specialized Service."</span>
        </p>

        <!-- Vision & Purpose Callout -->
        <div class="bg-sand p-6 rounded-2xl border border-hairline relative">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary text-canvas flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-1">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-body font-semibold text-base text-ink mb-1">Our Purpose & Vision</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
                To set a high standard for quality shade and tensile structure solutions in the UAE. To be recognized for dependable service, technical strength, thoughtful execution, and enduring client value through innovation, trust, and consistency.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Visual Feature with 2 Stacked Authentic Photos -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative" data-reveal="scale-up" data-reveal-delay="0.1">
        <div class="relative">
          <!-- Primary image -->
          <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-canvas aspect-[4/3] bg-navy-darker">
            <img 
              src="/images/about_main.png" 
              alt="Al Sahra Tensile Structure" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Inset Factory photo -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-6 sm:-left-8 w-3/4 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-canvas aspect-[16/10] bg-navy-darker hidden sm:block">
            <img 
              src="/images/inhouse_factory.png" 
              alt="Al Sahra Sharjah Al Dhaid In-House Manufacturing Facility" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-2.5 bg-navy-darker/80 backdrop-blur-sm text-canvas text-[11px] font-mono">
              Sharjah Al Dhaid Factory
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Pillar Execution Process (What We Do - Page 4) -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-hairline">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12" data-reveal="fade-up">
        <span class="font-mono text-primary text-xs uppercase tracking-[2px] font-semibold block mb-2">
          What We Do
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">
          Designed, forged and fabricated to each project
        </h3>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="bg-canvas p-8 rounded-2xl border border-hairline shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="0.05">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gold-accent/15 text-gold-accent flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-xl mb-6">
            01
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-body font-bold text-xl text-ink mb-3">Design Support</h4>
          <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Every product is individually designed to suit the client and the site conditions, drawing on years of specialized technical experience and structural calculations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="bg-canvas p-8 rounded-2xl border border-hairline shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="0.1">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/15 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-xl mb-6">
            02
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-body font-bold text-xl text-ink mb-3">In-House Manufacturing</h4>
          <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Fabric and steel works are forged and fabricated in our full-fledged Sharjah Al Dhaid facility to strict project specifications and international tensile standards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="bg-canvas p-8 rounded-2xl border border-hairline shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="0.15">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-ink/15 text-ink flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-xl mb-6">
            03
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-body font-bold text-xl text-ink mb-3">Installation & Care</h4>
          <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Skilled supervisors and certified installation crews handle site erection and ongoing maintenance support, ensuring no requirement goes unheeded.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
